  "id": "forest-cover-2020-v3",
  "title": "JRC Global Map of Forest Cover 2020, version 3 (deprecated)",
  "description": "Forest presence or absence in 2020 at 1/12000 degree (about 10 m), following the FAO forest definition that the EU Deforestation Regulation also uses. Produced by the European Commission Joint Research Centre (JRC), version 3, and mirrored unchanged from the JRC JEODPP server by Epoch as one global COG. The JRC has deprecated version 3 and removed it from JEODPP; Epoch keeps this copy because its URL is in use. New work must use version 4 (collection `forest-cover-2020-v4`). See [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) for a tested access recipe.",
